Loom: opt-in AIE2P bundle-planner controls for locked bodies (LOOM_EXP_LOCKED_PACK): pop / load hoisting, views and
floating ops off the order floor, the late read of vmov.vector512.to.accumulator512, branches in their delay window,
and a bank map that keeps memory ops off busy 16 KB banks. Unset: emits byte-identical.
